l_locator":"0feba9eef8b3f2beae20d4d067445792efedb67e4f08d9ca06949d66abf1fdae","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"d071df068b37f1e1d90915fadd65e2da808ac87efc2c621b73d095ee012aa652","logical_entry_identity":"ad95188c5631d07493f3bbdf34b27391139580b3b8b8717b39b778268853ed76","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Extracted from plants, wildlife or more exotic locations, poisons have always existed.\nMany creatures use them, along with some shady people.\n\nYou have made a deal with such a person and can now create new Rogue or Archer characters that can learn the #LIGHT_GREEN#Poisons talents#WHITE#.\n\nTalents:\n- #YELLOW#Vile Poisons: #WHITE#Learn new dangerous and terrible poisons to coat your weapons or ammo with, infecting your foes\n- #YELLOW#Venomous Strike: #WHITE#A terrible strike that deals increased nature damage based on the number of poison effects\n- #YELLOW#Empower Poisons: #WHITE#Learn to make your poisons even more lethal and fast\n- #YELLOW#Toxic Death: #WHITE#Spread the toxic joy to your foe's friends!\n","source_tag":"_t","target":"毒素取自植物、野生动物或更奇异的所在，自古便已存在。\n许多生物会使用毒素，一些见不得光的人也一样。\n\n你与这样的人做了交易，现在可以创建能学习 #LIGHT_GREEN#毒素系技能#WHITE# 的盗贼或弓箭手角色。\n\n技能：\n- #YELLOW# 邪恶毒素：#WHITE# 学会调制新的危险而可怕的毒素，将其涂在武器或弹药上，使敌人中毒。\n- #YELLOW# 毒素爆发：#WHITE# 发动一次可怕的攻击，目标身上的中毒效果越多，造成的自然伤害越高。\n- #YELLOW# 强化毒素：#WHITE# 让你的毒素变得更加致命、起效更快。\n- #YELLOW# 致命毒素：#WHITE# 将有毒的“快乐”分享给敌人的朋友们！\n"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"c3db7bb92951d71bcab3428824548a9e43a60c53e134b7122928feb1d3222846","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"d0728362a15a82f47b8df02163325d71a62f7ef2544cc5dbd45bec1fb9f9c176","logical_entry_identity":"f3bdc1b2afe52981ec812c5a69426e4f3da377e6d5db0067d003cd4ecc5fdfd4","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Sends a torrent of searing darkness through your foes, doing %d darkness damage. There is a 25%% chance the rushing darkness will blind them for 3 turns and cause them to lose track of their target.\n\t\tIf you know the Creeping Darkness talent, a short-lived trail of darkness is left in the beam's wake. Its damage is identical to that of Creeping Darkness's.\n\t\tThe damage will increase with your Mindpower. You do +%d%% damage to anything that has entered your creeping dark.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"向敌人发射一股灼热的黑暗能量，造成 %d 点黑暗伤害。黑暗能量有 25%% 概率致盲目标 3 回合并使它们丢失当前目标。\n\t\t\t如果你掌握黑暗之雾技能，会在射线范围内留下短暂的黑暗尾迹，其伤害等同于黑暗之雾的伤害。\n\t\t\t伤害受精神强度加成。你对任何进入黑暗之雾的人造成 +%d%% 伤害。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"5eea56a42dd5a372c386fe97f7b931a7e8192213b1dbf6bfcb084c5ff2332815","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"d0734fec941c4b50df49238ae85cb75c161a09e7c5023a4067fd4d65185f58eb","logical_entry_identity":"f78092939d48636a28d021341cfde347a3dae08dcb1266da7b920032d0dc20f4","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"and devoured as a demonic breakfast","source_tag":"_t","target":"并被恶魔当作早餐吞噬"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"a1f0c54e821d277894ccadb99ca2378e9c5b8b1ec32f5ee7b9b91627ae0c9345","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"d074e4079022d7333570085dc84dcfdd6617e353ab0dfc1e61bf711d833f503d","logical_entry_identity":"91d6bc38ccc221997ec4fb446a5a2eba1e17a52c692f241e120751bb8ce620d2","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"I'VE COME TO OFFER MORE AID.","source_tag":"_t","target":"我来接下一步的任务。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"1fc6dd0c9913dcac190aefce5637198e02b4898880ba780b2bdc5f42887ec0ab","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"d075fb87e6d0ec2e4ea82063f062c6f245100ec4cbd130ee4de3f15e58272ebf","logical_entry_identity":"e8b31c77702089f36ac027ee14c1a4f49457c84ef3d75d7b10410718d56603b6","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"cunning","source_tag":"talent type","target":"灵巧"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"7c56ca2b9d22d32cc3aaca82ffd21383832dc8d75ee1294c5692ffd219f38205","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"d0872e57b12606caa646995571708606983da2ddd29766f0407ec307d126f53a","logical_entry_identity":"4b332223bf758ad9b3d56123c2ebaccecee86affef56a9ccc6981173a3702f50","normalized_path":"mod-tome.